sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-burak-grid-cell-hexagonal-attractor> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-burak-grid-cell-hexagonal-attractor-code-traceability> .
